  "pages": [
    [
      {
        "type": "header",
        "bbox": [
          0.358,
          0.056,
          0.649,
          0.073
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "第十章 蛋白质、核酸的定位与检测"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "page_number",
        "bbox": [
          0.83,
          0.058,
          0.864,
          0.072
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "187"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.151,
          0.1,
          0.896,
          0.145
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（四）用免疫印迹法分析蛋白质，用抗 His 抗体或者 StrepTactin HRP 结合物（化学发光方法）免疫检测蛋白"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.157,
              0.1,
              0.891,
              0.121
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.216,
              0.125,
              0.564,
              0.143
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.109,
          0.156,
          0.899,
          0.218
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "参照 Laemmli（1970）的方法，用 12.5% SDS-PAGE 分离蛋白质。在电泳后，聚丙烯酰胺胶中的蛋白质通过半干电转法转移到聚偏二氟乙烯（PVDF）膜上，并通过免疫检测进行分析。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.157,
              0.157,
              0.892,
              0.174
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.178,
              0.892,
              0.195
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.201,
              0.267,
              0.215
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph_title",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.241,
          0.252,
          0.258
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "1. 溶液的配制"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.242,
              0.244,
              0.257
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.109,
          0.262,
          0.897,
          0.302
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（1）转移缓冲液:25mmol/L Tris 碱基、192mmol/L 甘氨酸、10%甲醇。配 1L，称 3.03g Tris 碱、14.4g 甘氨酸、100ml 甲醇，加蒸馏水到 1L。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.262,
              0.89,
              0.281
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.285,
              0.679,
              0.301
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.109,
          0.305,
          0.897,
          0.345
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(2) PBST: 8.4mmol/L "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\mathrm{Na_2HPO_4}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "、1.6mmol/L "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\mathrm{KH_2PO_4}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "、150mmol/L NaCl、"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "0.1\\%"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " (V/V) 吐温-20，加蒸馏水到 1L。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.305,
              0.891,
              0.323
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.325,
              0.475,
              0.343
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.347,
          0.899,
          0.388
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（3）封闭液:PBST中 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "2\\%"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " （ "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\omega /V"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " ）BSA。配 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " ，称2gBSA，加PBST到"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 。新鲜制备或在一 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "20^{\\circ}C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 保存。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.157,
              0.348,
              0.894,
              0.365
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.371,
              0.423,
              0.386
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.39,
          0.901,
          0.431
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（4）二抗稀释缓冲液:PBST中 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "5\\%"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " （ "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\omega /V"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " ）脱脂干牛奶（奶粉）。配 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " ，称5g奶粉，用PBST加到 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.391,
              0.894,
              0.409
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.414,
              0.368,
              0.429
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph_title",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.433,
          0.192,
          0.45
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2. 步骤"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.113,
              0.433,
              0.186,
              0.451
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.454,
          0.897,
          0.494
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（1）依照胶的大小，准备大小一样的膜一块以及 Whatman 3mm 层析纸 8 片。为了避免污染，均需要戴手套操作滤纸和膜。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.455,
              0.89,
              0.473
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.477,
              0.472,
              0.493
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.496,
          0.898,
          0.536
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（2）在 100% 甲醇（或乙醇）中浸湿 PVDF 膜 15s。把膜转化到一个蒸馏水（或者 Milli-QR）的容器中 2min。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.497,
              0.893,
              0.515
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.519,
              0.355,
              0.536
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.152,
          0.539,
          0.506,
          0.558
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(3) 在转移缓冲液中平衡膜至少 5min。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.159,
              0.541,
              0.5,
              0.556
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.153,
          0.56,
          0.438,
          0.579
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(4) 在转移缓冲液中浸润滤纸。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.562,
              0.432,
              0.576
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.154,
          0.582,
          0.438,
          0.6
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(5) 把胶浸润在转移缓冲液中。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.159,
              0.583,
              0.433,
              0.599
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.604,
          0.899,
          0.643
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(6) 在电泳板的正极中央放 4 层滤纸（正极，通常是红色），防止气泡的出现，把膜放在滤纸的上面。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.605,
              0.894,
              0.623
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.118,
              0.626,
              0.29,
              0.642
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.646,
          0.899,
          0.686
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(7) 把胶放在膜上面, 再在胶上放 4 层滤纸。在层叠的每一层轻轻地碾转巴斯德移液管可以移走气泡。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.159,
              0.647,
              0.893,
              0.665
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.669,
              0.29,
              0.685
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.153,
          0.688,
          0.735,
          0.708
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(8) 把负极连到上述组装好的转移叠垛上（负极，通常是黑色）。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.69,
              0.727,
              0.706
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.71,
          0.899,
          0.75
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（9）把正负电极连接好后，调节电流、电压、转移时间。电流是由胶的大小决定的，推荐 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1\\mathrm{mA} / \\mathrm{cm}^2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " （1h转化）。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.711,
              0.894,
              0.727
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.73,
              0.397,
              0.749
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.754,
          0.901,
          0.835
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(10) 转移后, 标记膜的起始和预染色的蛋白质标准带的位置。可以用 Ponceau-S 红（可逆染色剂）染色从而检测转移效果。把膜在染色溶液（0.5%Ponceau S，1%烟酸）中培育，并温和搅拌 2min。印迹一般会在蒸馏水中或者在接下来的免疫检测步骤中脱色。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.754,
              0.895,
              0.772
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.775,
              0.893,
              0.794
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.797,
              0.894,
              0.815
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.816,
              0.19,
              0.835
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.838,
          0.9,
          0.899
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（11）室温下，在封闭液中浸润膜至少1h。如果用StrepTactin HRP结合物来检测，随后在含有 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "2\\mu \\mathrm{g / ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 抗生物蛋白的PBST预处理膜30min，以封闭生物素化的蛋白质。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.158,
              0.84,
              0.894,
              0.858
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.86,
              0.895,
              0.879
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.88,
              0.172,
              0.899
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "type": "page_number",
        "bbox": [
          0.157,
          0.059,
          0.19,
          0.072
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "188"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "header",
        "bbox": [
          0.435,
          0.057,
          0.6,
          0.073
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.124,
          0.093,
          0.911,
          0.176
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（12）室温下，与稀释到 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1:2000\\sim 1:1000"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 的一抗（penta-His抗体，Qiagen）或者稀释到 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1:4000"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 的StrepTactin HRP结合物一起在封闭缓冲液中培育 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1\\mathrm{h}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " （注意:不要用含有奶粉的稀释缓冲液来与抗His的抗体相互作用。这会降低灵敏度。也不要用奶粉来和StrepTactin HRP结合物相互作用，因为它含有大量交联的生物素）。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.171,
              0.093,
              0.906,
              0.111
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.13,
              0.114,
              0.906,
              0.132
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.129,
              0.136,
              0.906,
              0.153
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.129,
              0.158,
              0.803,
              0.174
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.125,
          0.179,
          0.91,
          0.218
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（13）室温下，在 PBST 中洗涤膜 10min，重复 3 次。如果用 StrepTactin HRP 结合物时，直接跳到步骤（16）。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.171,
              0.18,
              0.906,
              0.196
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.131,
              0.202,
              0.395,
              0.217
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.125,
          0.222,
          0.911,
          0.282
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（14）室温下，与二抗溶液一起培育 1h。碱性磷酸盐或者辣根过氧化物酶（HRP）结合物的鼠抗 IgG 都可以使用。来自 DAKO 兔抗鼠的 IgG/HRP 结合物有很好的效果。当用到化学发光的方法时，在 PBST 中用 5% 脱脂奶粉和二抗一起培育。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.171,
              0.223,
              0.904,
              0.239
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.129,
              0.244,
              0.903,
              0.26
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.131,
              0.265,
              0.766,
              0.282
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.167,
          0.285,
          0.601,
          0.303
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(15) 室温下，用 PBST 洗涤 10min，重复 4 次。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.172,
              0.286,
              0.596,
              0.302
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.125,
          0.307,
          0.912,
          0.367
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（16）用 AP 或者 HRP 化学发光试剂进行检测反应，根据制造商的建议在 X-ray 胶片下曝光或者用发光成像系统来检测。免疫化学发光试剂（PerkinElmer）能够达到很好的效果。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.171,
              0.307,
